        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1155599
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-06T08:34:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good idea. My only concern is adding a layer of indirection, would it be clear enough why Gerrit is preventing you to comment on a change you could comment on before?\n\nHowever, we could always grant this permission explicitly if needed, so maybe this is acceptable.\n\nWould we still leave the schema upgrade granting the permission to all users by default in place?",
      "parentUuid": "fd28d067_849cc4b5",
      "revId": "bea114f75efad1ff9cf0c06696f267f68c7fc5d0",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "530a1eb3_7033cfe4",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003935
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-06T08:42:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Good idea. My only concern is adding a layer of indirection,\n\nWe have similar redirection for other permissions, e.g. project owners have some permissions implicitly, or the change owner implicitly has the Add Patch Set permission. So I think doing something similar here would be fine.\n\n\u003e would it be clear\n\u003e enough why Gerrit is preventing you to comment on a change you could comment on\n\u003e before?\n\u003e However, we could always grant this permission explicitly if needed, so maybe \u003e this is acceptable.\n\nYes, I think there is a risk that we break someone that did comment on changes without having any permision to vote on a label, but I think that\u0027s a rather small risk and may be acceptable.\n\n\n\u003e Would we still leave the schema upgrade granting the permission to all users by\n\u003e default in place?\n\nYes, I think it makes sense to keep this schema upgrade.",
      "parentUuid": "060ef67a_d2fcf9a6",
      "revId": "bea114f75efad1ff9cf0c06696f267f68c7fc5d0",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
